            <ArticleTitle>Gabapentin for treatment of neuropathic pain in a 12-year-old girl.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>354-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report on a 12-year-old girl with postthoracotomy neuropathic pain. A variety of treatments for the pain were ineffective. The symptoms resolved following the institution of therapy with gabapentin.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
